        "_key": "t20bs",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "Design either leads to action or decorates. The first one **sells**.",
          "The 9 moves below come from the studio's real projects, with numbers",
          "Case records: **2.4×** checkout clicks (Aleko), **3.2×** enquiries (Efedra), **$250,000+** raised (Tatarka)",
          "None of them require \"genius creativity\" — just discipline"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t20bt",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t20bu",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Clients often ask me to \"make it beautiful\". But beautiful is a side effect. The real job of commercial design is to walk a person to an action: an enquiry, a booking, a purchase. Here are nine moves we apply on every project — and the numbers they produced for real clients."
