        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t20bv",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "One action per screen. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t20bw",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Every screen answers one question and leads to one button. On the Aleko course landing page we cut everything that didn't lead to picking a tier — checkout clicks grew 2.4×."
