        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t20c7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Prices in plain sight. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t20c8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Prices filter out mismatched clients and build trust with the right ones. Hiding the price list means paying a manager to talk to people who can't afford you."
